 a few cells. Only the Type II cassette (PLCB2, GNAT3, TAS1R3, VIL1) reproduced in human tissue."], ["von Ebner serous acinar cell vs major-salivary serous acinar cell", [], "Both are AQP5+/EPCAM+ serous acinar cells sharing STATH, LYZ and histatins. LCN1 (tear lipocalin / von Ebner gland protein) is the discriminator: present in human von Ebner and lacrimal glands and absent from all other human salivary glands (8537027)."]], "oq": [], "ca": [], "sa": [{"name": "osteoclastogenic RANKL program", "markers": ["TNFSF11", "ETS1"], "pmids": ["40136507", "38554844"], "applies_to": ["mesenchymal cell"], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": []}, {"name": "proliferating", "markers": ["MKI67", "TOP2A", "CCNB1", "CENPF"], "pmids": ["12058064"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["tissue-resident macrophage", "basal keratinocyte", "fibroblast", "cancer-associated fibroblast", "T cell", "CD8-positive, alpha-beta T cell", "microglial cell", "endothelial cell", "basal prostate epithelial cell", "myeloid cell"]}, {"name": "senescent", "markers": ["CDKN1A", "CDKN2A", "GLB1", "SERPINE1"], "pmids": ["29477613"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["myoepithelial cell", "adipocyte"]}, {"name": "stemness", "markers": ["ALDH1A1", "CD44"], "pmids": ["12629218", "18371393"], "applies_to": ["epithelial cell"], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": []}, {"name": "heat-shock response", "markers": ["HSPA1A", "HSP90AA1", "DNAJB1"], "pmids": ["27502399"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["fibroblast"]}, {"name": "NRF2 oxidative stress response", "markers": ["NQO1", "HMOX1", "GCLM", "GCLC", "TXNRD1", "GSTA1", "SLC7A11"], "pmids": ["36085050", "37468583"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": []}, {"name": "YAP/TAZ activation", "markers": ["Ctgf", "Cyr61", "Ankrd1", "Amotl2", "Tead1"], "pmids": ["31080134"], "applies_to": ["mesenchymal cell", "epithelial cell", "endothelial cell"], "mimic